'''Chain Reinforcements''' is a Survive-tree passive that scales with level; the table above shows the exact effect at each of its 8 ranks.

== Effect ==

When a part of the armor is about to be shattered, its destruction is delayed by [ * ] seconds. During this period, it can withstand infinite damage, and taking damage immediately refreshes the delay duration.

